{'symbol': 'NWSA', 'date': '2020-01-06 10:30:00', 'title': "TREMOR INTERNATIONAL ACQUIRES NEWS CORP'S UNRULY", 'text': "TREMOR INTERNATIONAL ACQUIRES NEWS CORP'S UNRULY.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - NEWS CORP IS RECEIVING 6.91% OF TREMOR INTERNATIONAL STOCK, SUBJECT TO AN 18-MONTH LOCK UP PERIOD AND TO CERTAIN ADJUSTMENTS.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL LTD -  NEWS CORP IS RECEIVING A TOTAL MINIMUM REVENUE GUARANTEE FOR NEWS CORP OF GBP 30M FOR PARTNERSHIP.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - REBEKAH BROOKS, UK CEO AND NORM JOHNSTON, CEO AT UNRULY, ARE INTENDED TO JOIN BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TREMOR INTERNATIONAL IN NEAR FUTURE."}{'symbol': 'NWSA', 'date': '2020-01-06 05:30:00', 'title': "TREMOR INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCES ACQUISITION OF NEWS CORP'S UNRULY", 'text': "TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - REACHED AN AGREEMENT WITH NEWS CORP TO ACQUIRE UNRULY, NEWS CORP'S PROGRAMMATIC VIDEO MARKETPLACE.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - NEWS CORP ADVISED CO THAT DEAL IS ALSO EXPECTED TO BE FINANCIALLY BENEFICIAL TO NEWS CORP.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL- UNDER TERMS OF DEAL, TREMOR INTERNATIONAL HAS COMMITTED TO AN AD SPEND OF £30 MILLION WITH NEWS CORP OVER A THREE-YEAR PERIOD.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL LTD - DEAL EXPECTED TO BE BREAKEVEN IN THIS FINANCIAL YEAR, EXCLUDING INTEGRATION COSTS.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - DEAL EXPECTED TO POSITIVELY CONTRIBUTE TO ADJUSTED EBITDA IN FINANCIAL YEAR ENDING 31 DECEMBER 2021.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - FY ADJUSTED EBITDA EXPECTED TO BE IN-LINE WITH EXPECTATIONS.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL - FY 2019 GROUP REVENUE WILL BE BELOW EXPECTATIONS.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL-ENTERED PARTNERSHIP WITH NEWS CORP TO EQUIP CO RIGHT TO SELL OUTSTREAM VIDEO ON OVER 50 NEWS CORP TITLES IN UK, US& AUSTRALIA.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL LTD - NEWS CORP HAS ALSO AGREED TO CONTRIBUTE CASH TOWARDS COST OF INTEGRATING UNRULY WITH CO.TREMOR INTERNATIONAL LTD - ANTICIPATED THAT REBEKAH BROOKS, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF NEWS UK, WILL BE JOINING BOARD AS A NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR."}